# The stock cards SAYC and Natural (cards/README.md): the calls that tell
# them apart. Both sides play each section's card.
dealer  S

# ── SAYC (ACBL Standard American Yellow Card booklet).
card    SAYC
# seat hand             | auction          | expect | why
N 85.KJ9862.743.92      | 1NT P            | 2D     | Jacoby transfer: "2♦ is a transfer to hearts"
N 85.KJ986.743.Q92      | 1NT X            | 2D     | "If the opponents double, all conventional responses are on"
N KQ4.AJ83.K92.T76      | 1H P             | 2NT    | Jacoby 2NT: game-forcing raise, 13+ dummy points
W 2.KJ985.AQJ63.75      | 1C               | 2NT    | Unusual 2NT: the lower two unbid suits
W 8.KJ985.AQJ63.75      | 1S               | 2S     | Michaels: hearts and a minor
N AJ94.KQ82.K93.76      | 1H X             | 2NT    | Jordan: "2NT = limit raise (at least 10 points) or better"
S AK3.QJ2.KJ5.QT87      | 1NT P 4C P       | 4H     | Gerber over 1NT: 4♥ = one ace

# ── Natural: the .bbsa card. BBA plays Stayman and Jacoby transfers on
# every card (bbsa-map [implied]), so the stock Natural still transfers.
card    Natural
N 85.KJ9862.743.92      | 1NT P            | 2D     | Jacoby is implied by every .bbsa card
N KQ4.AJ83.K92.T76      | 1H P             | 2C     | no Jacoby 2NT: a new suit first, support later
W 2.KJ985.AQJ63.75      | 1C               | 1H     | no Unusual 2NT: overcall the higher five-card suit
N AJ94.KQ82.K93.76      | 1H X             | XX     | no Jordan 2NT: redouble with 10+
S 2.AQJ85.KQ3.KQ75      | 1H P 4H P        | 4NT    | plain Blackwood

# ── Natural as card JSON (cards/json/Natural.json), which can turn the
# transfers off: 1NT–2♥ is to play.
card    ../../cards/json/Natural.json
N 85.KJ9862.743.92      | 1NT P            | 2H     | natural: five or more hearts, to play
N KQ4.AJ83.K92.T76      | 1H P             | 2C     | no Jacoby 2NT
